# Catch-all for root harness/RE working artifacts. NOTE: the kept docs are _*.md
# (_TODO_1TO1, _RE_*, _HANDOVER, _ENGINE_GOTCHAS, _RE_INDEX, _PROJECT_LOG, etc.) and
# the scripts are _*.ps1 (_smoke_all_saves, _harness_drive) — those are NOT matched here.
# Everything else prefixed "_" is a disposable working artifact: logs, tsv/csv, json/txt
# dumps (e.g. _commitmsg.txt, _dump_out.log, harness traces). No tracked file has a
# basename starting with "_" except the kept .md/.ps1, so these broad globs are safe.
_*.log
_*.tsv
_*.csv
_*.json
_*.txt
_re_tmp_*
_sweep/
_smoke_logs/
data/exported/
